[00:02.32] Lost, here is nowhere
[00:11.14] Searching home still
[00:15.74] Turning past me, all are gone
[00:28.83] Time is now
[00:38.99] 
[03:27.29] The omen showed, took me away
[03:41.70] Preparations are done, this can't last
[03:53.54] 
[03:57.19] The mere reflection brought disgust
[04:07.53] 
[04:10.87] No ordeal to conquer, this firm slit
[04:29.61] 
[04:44.47] It sheds upon the floor, dripping into a pool
[04:56.76] 
[04:59.43] Grant me sleep, take me under
[05:09.92] 
[05:13.85] Like the wings of a dove, folding around
[05:28.54] I fade into this tender care
[05:44.14] 